  "bodyHash": "11ebdc7a71e78ecc",
  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>簡潔提示框</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=5865F2&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&color=393939&labelColor=FF424D&logoColor=FFFFFF\" alt=\"\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您是否覺得預設的提示框可以稍微美化一下？那麼這正是您所需要的。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組主要全面改進了附魔在提示框中的顯示方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>它們現在擁有獨立的「附魔：」子分類</li>\n<li>使用顏色編碼，讓好附魔（綠色）與詛咒（紅色）更容易區分</li>\n<li>滿級附魔將以金色顯示&nbsp;</li>\n<li>詛咒始終排列在列表最下方</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>安裝模組後：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 未安裝模組（原版）：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/855017/description_8db9358c-7a9f-4728-9c44-89ac3a8115da.png\"></p>\n<p>除此之外，其他部分也得到了改善：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>染色物品的顏色條現在會正確顯示所使用的顏色&nbsp;</li>\n<li>受損物品會在提示框中顯示剩餘耐久度&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/855017/description_2976db1f-4d43-4208-98f9-a2c00fcbef3f.png\"></p>\n<p>我們對於未來如何進一步優化提示框還有許多想法。除了新增功能外，後續更新也將加入大量自訂選項。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4r5WLBc.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"300\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fpeqHMC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1152\" height=\"300\"></p>",
